67718,"cold_jump_vs_P0_m":1.922861494,"gate":"OK_UNBAKED(0)","is_baked":false,"sequential_vs_P0":"0.000000 m（逐位相同）","unbake_saved":"H_nobake.blend","verdict":"不烘焙交付可行，但必须按序求值"},"p8_classification":{"D_all_m":0.469992,"D_hem_m":0.000385,"comparison_kind":"mechanism_probe","statements":["限位变量是活的（0.385 mm ≠ 0）","按 18 根下摆 1.0 mm 判据不达阈值","D_all 是混沌放大，不得读成偏转量"],"verdict":"BELOW_CRITERION"},"rebake_fix":{"chosen":"解烘焙后保存（is_baked=false）","rejected":"重烘焙（被 10 §6 的 bake_all 禁令挡死）"},"verdicts":["OK_UNBAKED","OK_BAKED_CONSISTENT","OK_NO_PHYSICS","DEFECT_BAKED_OUTDATED","UNREADABLE"]},"known_risks":["attempt 6 的 artifacts 里 `m02_s8_ab.py` 登记的是 420abfa4…，而该文件在证据生成后又被编辑（P10 分支修正、design 字段、direct_changed、REQUIRE_CHANGE 护栏），盘上为 76d4429b…。本笔按最终脚本重算并重新生成证据；此后不再编辑任何已登记文件。","P11 的 probe 用「单帧跳转」得到第三条轨迹（与 A1 差 2.30 m、与 P0 差 1.92 m）：不烘焙文件冷跳到中间帧时，解算从该帧起算，不是从第 1 帧。按序重算（`P11seq`，1→240 逐帧）与 P0 **逐位 0.000000** ⇒ 渲染/顺序求值路径就是重算那条。","因此「不烘焙交付」的契约必须写死：打开后不要直接跳到中间帧再渲染，按 scene.frame_start 起顺序求值（渲染默认即如此）。","P10 第一次（13:17:19–13:17:46）是空跑：`elif variant == \"P10\"` 被写在了已有的 `elif variant in (…, \"P10\")` no-op 分支之后，实际未改动任何对象，`changed_bodies=0`。修正后重跑（13:18:0x–13:18:27，`changed_bodies=11`）才给出真实差异。旧目录已被覆盖，此处保留两次的时间与计数作为审计线索；D0 13:18 那句「P0 vs P10 逐位 0」即基于空跑。","P10 修正后：`D_hem = 5.714589 mm`、`D_all = 1.652268 m`（324 刚体 × 240 帧）。⇒ 8.24 mm 里最大的一块来自那 11 个跨骨架静态占位刚体，不是飞霄骨架内部。","本笔修改了两个已在 attempt 4 里登记的产物，旧 sha256 不再等于盘上文件：","s2_cachefree_limit_05.json：fd08e55d…c4e9709 → b0b433f4…d8018206（D0 裁决：UNKNOWN 是「没测出来」的专用词，本条测出来了，改用 comparison_kind=mechanism_probe + verdict=BELOW_CRITERION）","result_attempt4.md：987b51bc…b399d95d4 → 72fc969b…f39d8018206（同上，并把「位移出现在链的下游」写进正文：最大位移骨 043_下擺_0_1，被削的是 下擺_0_11/0_12）","attempt 3 的 result_attempt3.md 删掉了「再收紧到 0.5 rad 同样是零效果」这句未测推断，改为指向 attempt 4 的实测；其余内容与 s8 判据未动。","cache_gate_inventory.json 是 out/ 下全部 15 个 .blend 的缓存状态快照（6 个 DEFECT、9 个 OK），随工程增删会变，不是稳态事实。","cache_state.py 只做判据，不含任何 bpy 观测代码；观测侧仍由 m02_cache_gate.py 提供，stage.py 的调用由 4号 接（D0 定的 A+ 边界）。","重烘焙（is_baked=true && is_outdated=false）需要 `bpy.ops.ptcache.bake_all()`，被 10 §6 禁用，所以修法只能取「解烘焙后保存」，不是待办。","`variant_designs.json` 是事后补写（晚于各次运行），未回改任何 meta.json；meta 里的四个改动计数与 `placeholder_bodies` 是身份指纹。"],"spec":"evidence/1","status":"PARTIAL","task_id":"M02","tests":[{"cmd":"python -m unittest tests.test_cache_state (A1 @f0c8b2a)","exit":0,"failed":0,"passed":18,"skipped":0},{"cmd":"python -m unittest discover -s tests (A1 @f0c8b2a)","exit":0,"failed":0,"passed":146,"skipped":15},{"cmd":"blender -b -P m02_s8_ab.py -- G_base.blend P10（修正分支顺序后重跑）","exit":0,"failed":0,"passed":1,"skipped":0},{"cmd":"blender -b -P m02_s8_p11.py -- make G_base.blend H_nobake.blend","exit":0,"failed":0,"passed":1,"skipped":0},{"cmd":"blender -b -P m02_s8_p11.py -- probe H_nobake.blend 109（新进程）","exit":0,"failed":0,"passed":1,"skipped":0},{"cmd":"blender -b -P m02_cache_gate.py -- H_nobake.blend","exit":0,"failed":0,"passed":1,"skipped":0},{"cmd":"blender -b -P m02_s8_ab.py -- H_nobake.blend A（不烘焙按序重算 240 帧）","exit":0,"failed":0,"passed":1,"skipped":0},{"cmd":"blender -b -P m02_cache_gate.py -- B_from_blend1.blend prepared_baseline.blend（应当被拒的输入：baked+outdated）","exit":3,"failed":0,"passed":1,"skipped":0},{"cmd":"blender -b -P m02_cache_gate.py -- <out 下全部 15 个 .blend>","exit":3,"failed":0,"passed":15,"skipped":0}]}